ree-day gathering, pro-Trump conservatives tried to turn “cancel culture” into their new “fake news” and spent little time on policy (either their own or President Biden’s).', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/02/28/us/politics/cpac-trump-kristi-noem.html', 'snippet': 'At their three-day gathering, pro-Trump conservatives tried to turn “cancel culture” into their new “fake news” and spent little time on policy (either their own or President Biden’s).', 'lead_paragraph': 'Any lingering belief that Donald J. Trump would fade from the political scene like other past presidents evaporated fully on Sunday as he spoke for more than 90 minutes in a grievance-filled and self-promoting address that sought to polish up his presidential legacy, take aim at his enemies and tease his political future.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/02/28/us/politics/28cpac-takeaways1/merlin_184399473_c7a01d25-83d4-4cf5-8e7a-af393cdc388f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/02/28/us/politics/28cpac-takeaways1/merlin_184399473_c7a01d25-83d4-4cf5-8e7a-af393cdc388f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/02/28/us/politics/28cpac-takeaways1/merlin_184399473_c7a01d25-83d4-4cf5-8e7a-af393cdc388f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/02/28/us/politics/28cpac-takeaways1/merlin_184399473_c7a01d25-83d4-4cf5-8e7a-af393cdc388f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': N