epublicans still embrace the power of the ex-president’s agenda to galvanize voters and drive turnout.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Donald Trump era isn’t over for the Republican Party. He is the party’s kingmaker, and two impeachments and a re-election defeat have not quelled Republican voters’ enthusiasm for him. As no less a critic of the ex-president than Senator Mitt Romney has acknowledged, he will be the party’s presumptive front-runner if he chooses to run for president again.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/02/opinion/01mccarthy1/merlin_184385514_dd669587-949b-4fd9-96e2-e5bd04b7aaa8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/02/opinion/01mccarthy1/merlin_184385514_dd669587-949b-4fd9-96e2-e5bd04b7aaa8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/02/opinion/01mccarthy1/merlin_184385514_dd669587-949b-4fd9-96e2-e5bd04b7aaa8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/02/opinion/01mccarthy1/merlin_184385514_dd669587-949b-4fd9-96e2-e5bd04b7aaa8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/02/opinion/01mccarthy1/01mccarthy1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/02/opinion/01mccarthy1/01mccarthy1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75