 that differs markedly from the first two authorized vaccines, made by Pfizer-BioNTech and Moderna.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Here is what we know about the rollout of the Johnson & Johnson vaccine.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'internal-essential', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vaccination and Immunization', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Johnson & Johnson', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-03-01T22:00:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick J. Lyons', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Lyons', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3551eb0b-f115-5324-8ff6-82d346925b13', 'word_count': 521, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3551eb0b-f115-5324-8ff6-82d346925b13'}, {'abstract': 'Despite falling from power in Washington, the Republican Party has done little soul-searching or reflection on a new agenda, instead focusing on attacking Democrats and the news media.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/01/us/politics/trump-republicans-policy.html', 'snippet': 'Despite falling from power in Washington, the Republican Party has done little soul-searching or reflection on a new agenda, instead focusing on attacking Democrats and the news media.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ORLANDO, Fla. — For decades, the same ritual took place in the aftermath of Republican electoral defeats.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia'