ce Cathedral. She was struck by the patience, vision and spiritual devotion it took to erect these ambitious buildings — projects that often took more than three generations to complete. “I have always loved the idea that patrons like Cosimo de’ Medici invested in work that they knew they would never see in their lifetime,” she says.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '42', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/02/t-magazine/02tmag-valentina-slide-RBPK/02tmag-valentina-slide-RBPK-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/02/t-magazine/02tmag-valentina-slide-RBPK/02tmag-valentina-slide-RBPK-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/02/t-magazine/02tmag-valentina-slide-RBPK/02tmag-valentina-slide-RBPK-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/02/t-magazine/02tmag-valentina-slide-RBPK/02tmag-valentina-slide-RBPK-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1123, 'width': 1684, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/02/t-magazine/02tmag-valentina-slide-RBPK/02tmag-valentina-slide-RBPK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/02/t-magazine/02tmag-valentina-slide-RBPK/02tmag-valentina-slide-RBPK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2