ed straps in alligator and leather.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/02/t-magazine/bright-watches-color-spring.html', 'snippet': 'A new crop of timepieces marries peppy dials and sophisticated straps in alligator and leather.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Historically, vibrant watch dials have largely been the purview of sporty styles. Now, though, they can be found on more classic options featuring leather or alligator bands and cases of bronze, titanium, stainless steel or Platinumtech (an alloy reformulated to be tougher than conventional platinum). Those shown here are flush with jewel tones including ocean blue, olive green and burgundy. And with the dark days of winter ever waning, there’s no time like the present to try one out.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '46', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/02/t-magazine/02tmag-watchreport/02tmag-watchreport-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 726, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/02/t-magazine/02tmag-watchreport/02tmag-watchreport-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 726}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/02/t-magazine/02tmag-watchreport/02tmag-watchreport-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 846, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/02/t-magazine/02tmag-watchreport/02tmag-watchreport-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1692, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/02/t-magazine/02tmag-watchreport/02tmag-watchreport-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType':