://article/2a5b7c25-568b-5fc8-817b-ac25cecc674b'}, {'abstract': 'The painting, “Tower of the Koutoubia Mosque,” was a gift to Jolie by Brad Pitt and is believed to be Churchill’s only World War II-era landscape.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/02/arts/design/angelina-jolie-churchill-painting-auction.html', 'snippet': 'The painting, “Tower of the Koutoubia Mosque,” was a gift to Jolie by Brad Pitt and is believed to be Churchill’s only World War II-era landscape.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — A painting first owned by President Franklin D. Roosevelt, and now being sold by the actress Angelina Jolie, elevated the art of British Prime Minister Winston Churchill to a new price league at auction at Christie’s on Monday.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/04/arts/02churchill-painting/merlin_184444707_8bd741ce-3739-49d0-9bd4-3057be6d8542-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 440, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/04/arts/02churchill-painting/merlin_184444707_8bd741ce-3739-49d0-9bd4-3057be6d8542-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 440}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/04/arts/02churchill-painting/merlin_184444707_8bd741ce-3739-49d0-9bd4-3057be6d8542-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 751, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/04/arts/02churchill-painting/merlin_184444707_8bd741ce-3739-49d0-9bd4-3057be6d8542-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1501, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/0