oting and regulating American business.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/02/us/politics/gina-raimondo-commerce-secretary.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Raimondo is expected to leverage her private and public sector experience to oversee a sprawling bureaucracy that is charged with both promoting and regulating American business.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Senate on Tuesday confirmed Gina Raimondo, a former governor of Rhode Island and a former venture capitalist, as the next secretary of commerce.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/02/us/politics/02new-washington-briefing-raimondo/merlin_171224388_62f29657-c3f3-4546-81c1-a6f3e9a243cf-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 413, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/02/us/politics/02new-washington-briefing-raimondo/merlin_171224388_62f29657-c3f3-4546-81c1-a6f3e9a243cf-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 413}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/02/us/politics/02new-washington-briefing-raimondo/merlin_171224388_62f29657-c3f3-4546-81c1-a6f3e9a243cf-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 705, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/02/us/politics/02new-washington-briefing-raimondo/merlin_171224388_62f29657-c3f3-4546-81c1-a6f3e9a243cf-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1411, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/02/us/politics/02new-washington-briefing-raimondo/02new-washington-briefing-raimondo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'l