 are making plans for “hybrid” work arrangements.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/03/business/return-to-work-coronavirus.html', 'snippet': 'Many employers are not making a decision until many workers are vaccinated. And some are making plans for “hybrid” work arrangements.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A year and a pandemic ago, over 100,000 people filled the central business district in Charlotte, N.C., pouring out of offices, including several recently built skyscrapers, and into restaurants, bars and sports venues. Then as the coronavirus sent employees to their homes, much of the city center quickly went quiet and dark.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/02/22/us/00office-06/merlin_183996234_f4ba7f60-79df-44f6-a9cd-2e45441c3375-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 429, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/02/22/us/00office-06/merlin_183996234_f4ba7f60-79df-44f6-a9cd-2e45441c3375-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 429}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/02/22/us/00office-06/merlin_183996234_f4ba7f60-79df-44f6-a9cd-2e45441c3375-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 731, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/02/22/us/00office-06/merlin_183996234_f4ba7f60-79df-44f6-a9cd-2e45441c3375-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1463, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/02/22/us/00office-06/00office-06-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'t