ggiore area, near Italy’s border with Switzerland, ‘understated buyers’ are being lured away from ritzier destinations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/03/realestate/house-hunting-in-italy-a-tower-north-of-milan-south-of-1-million.html', 'snippet': 'In the Lake Maggiore area, near Italy’s border with Switzerland, ‘understated buyers’ are being lured away from ritzier destinations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This six-bedroom home is in Cavallirio, a small town in the hills of Novara province, in the Piedmont region of northwest Italy. Located about 12 miles from Lake Maggiore, Italy’s second largest lake, the home has a castle-like wing with a turreted tower that dates to the late 18th century. The living areas have frescoed walls, soaring ceilings and marble mosaic-tile floors. The furniture is not included in the sale price.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/03/realestate/03IHH-LakeMaggiore-slide-F7CH/03IHH-LakeMaggiore-slide-F7CH-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/03/realestate/03IHH-LakeMaggiore-slide-F7CH/03IHH-LakeMaggiore-slide-F7CH-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/03/realestate/03IHH-LakeMaggiore-slide-F7CH/03IHH-LakeMaggiore-slide-F7CH-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/03/realestate/03IHH-LakeMaggiore-slide-F7CH/03IHH-LakeMaggiore-slide-F7CH-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail',