Manuel López Obrador is supporting a candidate accused of rape. Women may need to give up on him.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/04/opinion/international-world/amlo-feminist-salgado-macedonio.html', 'snippet': 'Andrés Manuel López Obrador is supporting a candidate accused of rape. Women may need to give up on him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MEXICO CITY — President Andrés Manuel López Obrador is in the middle of a political storm. His party nominated Félix Salgado Macedonio, who has been accused by five women of rape and sexual harassment, as a candidate for governor of Guerrero State.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/04/opinion/04Rios1/merlin_183784554_e552bf7c-cb8d-4a22-b5a6-d41eae37b74d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/04/opinion/04Rios1/merlin_183784554_e552bf7c-cb8d-4a22-b5a6-d41eae37b74d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/04/opinion/04Rios1/merlin_183784554_e552bf7c-cb8d-4a22-b5a6-d41eae37b74d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/04/opinion/04Rios1/merlin_183784554_e552bf7c-cb8d-4a22-b5a6-d41eae37b74d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/04/opinion/04Rios1/04Rios1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/04/opin