id they aren’t worried about a pop in longer-term bond yields. If they do become concerned, they have some options.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/04/business/economy/fed-treasury-bonds-jerome-powell.html', 'snippet': 'Central bankers have said they aren’t worried about a pop in longer-term bond yields. If they do become concerned, they have some options.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Longer-term interest rates have jumped in recent weeks, a move that has been broadly interpreted as a sign that investors are betting higher growth and slightly faster inflation may be right around the corner.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/04/business/04dc-fedexplain1/merlin_180682581_69c60dc5-6ef1-40ee-b315-ae538db17a6a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/04/business/04dc-fedexplain1/merlin_180682581_69c60dc5-6ef1-40ee-b315-ae538db17a6a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/04/business/04dc-fedexplain1/merlin_180682581_69c60dc5-6ef1-40ee-b315-ae538db17a6a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/04/business/04dc-fedexplain1/merlin_180682581_69c60dc5-6ef1-40ee-b315-ae538db17a6a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/04/business/04dc-fedexplain1/04dc-fedexplain1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'th