ts for an unlikely delicacy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/04/movies/the-truffle-hunters-review.html', 'snippet': 'An enchanting documentary about men and their best friends combing the northern Italian forests for an unlikely delicacy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The history of human gastronomy is full of mysteries. Who figured out that an oyster was something to eat? That fruit juice left sitting around for a while would get you drunk? That a kid would eat the middle of an Oreo first? I am now convinced that these imponderables pale in comparison to the question of the truffle. How did this subterranean fungus, the best specimens of which look like woebegone potatoes, come to be among the most prized and pricey of delicacies?', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/04/arts/04truffle-1/04truffle-1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 325, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/04/arts/04truffle-1/04truffle-1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 325}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/04/arts/04truffle-1/04truffle-1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 555, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/04/arts/04truffle-1/04truffle-1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1040, 'width': 1920, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/04/arts/04truffle-1/04truffle-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/04/art