': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/637cae2c-462f-5efe-9ac5-002d763a7421', 'word_count': 824, 'uri': 'nyt://article/637cae2c-462f-5efe-9ac5-002d763a7421'}, {'abstract': 'The earthquake swarm is the culmination of more than a year of intense seismic activity. It could also herald decades of intermittent volcanic eruptions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/04/world/europe/earthquakes-eruption-iceland.html', 'snippet': 'The earthquake swarm is the culmination of more than a year of intense seismic activity. It could also herald decades of intermittent volcanic eruptions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Volcanoes in southwestern Iceland have been quiet for 800 years, but the period of rest may soon be over: More than 18,000 earthquakes have shaken the area in just over a week, leading scientists to believe that an eruption could be imminent.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/04/world/04iceland-1/merlin_184516050_5e565fe7-1644-4571-b629-554df8a78b9a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/04/world/04iceland-1/merlin_184516050_5e565fe7-1644-4571-b629-554df8a78b9a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/04/world/04iceland-1/merlin_184516050_5e565fe7-1644-4571-b629-554df8a78b9a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/04/world/04iceland-1/merlin_184516050_5e565fe7-1644-4571-b629-554df8a78b9a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_na