03/04/health/covid-vaccine-johnson-and-johnson-rollout.html', 'snippet': 'Johnson & Johnson’s one-shot vaccine is allowing states to rethink distribution, even as health officials and experts worry some will view it as inferior.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In North Dakota this week, health officials are sending their first Johnson & Johnson Covid-19 vaccines to pharmacies and urgent care clinics, where people who don’t necessarily have a regular doctor can get the single jab. In Missouri, doses are going to community health centers and rural hospitals. And in North Carolina, health providers are using it to inoculate meatpacking, farm and grocery workers.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/04/science/04VIRUS-JJSTATES1b/merlin_184521282_173142a8-f352-48d1-a807-c8a33f15d9a2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/04/science/04VIRUS-JJSTATES1b/merlin_184521282_173142a8-f352-48d1-a807-c8a33f15d9a2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/04/science/04VIRUS-JJSTATES1b/merlin_184521282_173142a8-f352-48d1-a807-c8a33f15d9a2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/04/science/04VIRUS-JJSTATES1b/merlin_184521282_173142a8-f352-48d1-a807-c8a33f15d9a2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/04/science/04VIRUS-JJSTATES1b/04VIRUS-JJSTATES1b-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height