e/e7face8a-f66f-5495-af8a-38d7c5216f6d'}, {'abstract': 'The director Craig Brewer narrates a sequence featuring the star alongside Arsenio Hall, Leslie Jones, Tracy Morgan and Jermaine Fowler.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/05/movies/coming-2-america-clip.html', 'snippet': 'The director Craig Brewer narrates a sequence featuring the star alongside Arsenio Hall, Leslie Jones, Tracy Morgan and Jermaine Fowler.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In “Anatomy of a Scene,” we ask directors to reveal the secrets that go into making key scenes in their movies. See new episodes in the series on Fridays. You can also watch our collection of more than 150 videos on YouTube and subscribe to our YouTube channel.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Watch Eddie Murphy’s Return to Queens in ‘Coming 2 America’', 'kicker': 'Anatomy of a Scene', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Murphy, Eddie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brewer, Craig', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hall, Arsenio', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jones, Leslie (1967- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Morgan, Tracy', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Coming 2 America (Movie)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-03-05T16:01:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mekado Murphy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mekado', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Murphy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/812a8cc2-681d-557e-9f5a-4c9641447fbb', 'word_count': 355, 'uri': 'nyt://article/812a8cc2-681d-557e-9f5a-4c9641447fbb'}, {'abstract': 'As officials in Texas and Mississippi lifted statewide mask requirements, researchers at the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention offered a new study with fresh evidence of masks’ importance.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/05/world/cdc-masks-dining-virus.html', 'snippet': 'As officials in Texas and Mississippi lifted statewide mask requirements, researchers at the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention offered a new study with fresh evidence of masks’ importance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As officials in Texas and Mississippi lifted statewide mask mandates, researchers at the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention offered fresh evidence of the importance of mask use in a new study on Friday. Wearing masks, the study reported, was linked to fewer infections with the coronavirus and Covid-19 deaths in counties across the United States.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The C.D.C. links restaurant dining and a lack of mask mandates to the virus’s spread in the U.S.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus Risks and Safety Concerns', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Centers for Disease Control and Prevention', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-03-05T16:10:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Roni Caryn Rabin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Roni', 'middlename': 'Caryn', 'lastname': 'Rabin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material