had requested that the generals take more control “for the benefit of the people.”  At least three protesters were killed in further crackdowns.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/08/world/asia/myanmar-coup-violence.html', 'snippet': 'The military said the public had requested that the generals take more control “for the benefit of the people.”  At least three protesters were killed in further crackdowns.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Workplaces across Myanmar were shuttered on Monday, part of a general strike aimed at strangling the power of military rulers who toppled an elected government last month. But if manufacturing and commerce were idled, anger at the brutality of the military flared further, despite the increased presence of security forces in urban centers and a tougher clampdown on the press.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/08/world/08myanmar-add1/merlin_184753356_26defab3-6edc-432c-b30a-9f0884283e01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/08/world/08myanmar-add1/merlin_184753356_26defab3-6edc-432c-b30a-9f0884283e01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/08/world/08myanmar-add1/merlin_184753356_26defab3-6edc-432c-b30a-9f0884283e01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/08/world/08myanmar-add1/merlin_184753356_26defab3-6edc-432c-b30a-9f0884283e01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'u