not be streamed live, though audio will be available. Once the jury is chosen, the trial can be watched on nytimes.com.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The trial of Derek Chauvin in the death of George Floyd will be unusual for many reasons: It will be livestreamed from Minneapolis, attendance will be severely limited because of the coronavirus, and the public’s interest in the case may make this one of the highest-profile trials in recent memory.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/05/us/00chauvin-floyd-blog3/merlin_183427977_03be5463-4be6-4602-8131-bc8eee0f2551-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/05/us/00chauvin-floyd-blog3/merlin_183427977_03be5463-4be6-4602-8131-bc8eee0f2551-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/05/us/00chauvin-floyd-blog3/merlin_183427977_03be5463-4be6-4602-8131-bc8eee0f2551-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/05/us/00chauvin-floyd-blog3/merlin_183427977_03be5463-4be6-4602-8131-bc8eee0f2551-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/05/us/00chauvin-floyd-blog3/00chauvin-floyd-blog2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/05/us/00chauvin-floyd-blog3/00chauvin-floyd-blog2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarg