Wynton Marsalis and more. Plus, an inside look at our coverage.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/08/us/covid-year-live-event.html', 'snippet': 'Reckon with the pandemic’s toll and how we come back, with The Times’s Marc Lacey, Wynton Marsalis and more. Plus, an inside look at our coverage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In March 2020, the World Health Organization declared Covid-19 a global pandemic. Since then, the coronavirus has claimed more than 2.7 million lives globally, including more than 540,000 people in the United States. Behind these unfathomable numbers are countless more lives upended forever — by the loss of loved ones, of jobs and of the joys of everyday life.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/16/us/16Covid-eventSOCIAL/16Covid-eventSOCIAL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/16/us/16Covid-eventSOCIAL/16Covid-eventSOCIAL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/16/us/16Covid-eventSOCIAL/16Covid-eventSOCIAL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/16/us/16Covid-eventSOCIAL/16Covid-eventSOCIAL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1080, 'width': 1920, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/16/us/16Covid-eventSOCIAL/16Covid-eventSOCIAL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/16/us/16Covid-eventSOCIAL/16Covid-eventSOCIAL-thumb