 regulations by Betsy DeVos that gave the force of law to rules that granted more due-process rights to students accused of sexual assault.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Biden on Monday directed the Education Department to conduct an expansive review of all policies on sex and gender discrimination and violence in schools, effectively beginning his promised effort to dismantle Trump-era rules on sexual misconduct that afforded greater protections to students accused of assault.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/08/us/politics/08dc-BIDEN-TITLEIX-2/merlin_184492920_ed3dac99-9018-4ab0-ba41-e0759f88c5f0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/08/us/politics/08dc-BIDEN-TITLEIX-2/merlin_184492920_ed3dac99-9018-4ab0-ba41-e0759f88c5f0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/08/us/politics/08dc-BIDEN-TITLEIX-2/merlin_184492920_ed3dac99-9018-4ab0-ba41-e0759f88c5f0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/08/us/politics/08dc-BIDEN-TITLEIX-2/merlin_184492920_ed3dac99-9018-4ab0-ba41-e0759f88c5f0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/08/us/politics/08dc-BIDEN-TITLEIX-2/08dc-BIDEN-TITLEIX-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/08/us/politic