bstract': 'Hundreds of thousands of Venezuelans can temporarily continue to live and work in the United States as the administration considers its next steps in the effort to force out Venezuela’s president.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/08/us/politics/biden-venezuela-maduro.html', 'snippet': 'Hundreds of thousands of Venezuelans can temporarily continue to live and work in the United States as the administration considers its next steps in the effort to force out Venezuela’s president.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — As many as 320,000 Venezuelans living in the United States were given an 18-month reprieve on Monday from the threat of being deported, as the Biden administration sought to highlight how dangerous that country has become under President Nicolás Maduro.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/08/us/politics/08dc-diplo-venezuela/merlin_184778427_21fb88ca-4222-4ec4-b14a-5ee7ae2d8e5e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/08/us/politics/08dc-diplo-venezuela/merlin_184778427_21fb88ca-4222-4ec4-b14a-5ee7ae2d8e5e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/08/us/politics/08dc-diplo-venezuela/merlin_184778427_21fb88ca-4222-4ec4-b14a-5ee7ae2d8e5e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/08/us/politics/08dc-diplo-venezuela/merlin_184778427_21fb88ca-4222-4ec4-b14a-5ee7ae2d8e5e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype':