Children and Childhood', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mental Health and Disorders', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Royal Families', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Harry, Duke of Sussex', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Markle, Meghan', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Winfrey, Oprah', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'van der Kolk, Bessel', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-03-09T20:05:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benedict Carey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benedict', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9407ec7c-0065-55d2-9b8b-ac3dc9bbcb50', 'word_count': 946, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9407ec7c-0065-55d2-9b8b-ac3dc9bbcb50'}, {'abstract': 'As part of the cutbacks, BuzzFeed closed HuffPost Canada and announced plans to decrease the size of its operations in Australia and Britain.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/09/business/media/huffpost-layoffs-buzzfeed.html', 'snippet': 'As part of the cutbacks, BuzzFeed closed HuffPost Canada and announced plans to decrease the size of its operations in Australia and Britain.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When BuzzFeed announced last year that it would buy HuffPost, it was expected that cost-cutting would follow the completion of the deal. On Tuesday, less than a month after the acquisition went through, BuzzFeed laid off 47 workers at HuffPost and closed the publication’s Canadian edition.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/09/business/09e