 media and fringe news sites, influencing people already facing other hurdles to getting vaccinated. Some activists are going door to door to counter it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/10/technology/vaccine-misinformation.html', 'snippet': 'The false information arrives on social media and fringe news sites, influencing people already facing other hurdles to getting vaccinated. Some activists are going door to door to counter it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN JOSE, Calif. — On an unseasonably warm day in February, two men working with a local community group went door to door in an ethnically diverse neighborhood to persuade people to sign up for Covid-19 vaccinations.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/10/us/00VACCINE-DISINFO-promo/merlin_184804653_7e36692d-0a04-4e27-aef6-cc1d0ff2f35c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/10/us/00VACCINE-DISINFO-promo/merlin_184804653_7e36692d-0a04-4e27-aef6-cc1d0ff2f35c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/10/us/00VACCINE-DISINFO-promo/merlin_184804653_7e36692d-0a04-4e27-aef6-cc1d0ff2f35c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/10/us/00VACCINE-DISINFO-promo/merlin_184804653_7e36692d-0a04-4e27-aef6-cc1d0ff2f35c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/10/us/00VACCINE-DISINFO-promo/00VACCINE-DISIN