-b1aa4c0706be'}, {'abstract': 'The congressman from Huntsville, Ala., was quick to claim that the 2020 election was stolen. His district continues to get special treatment.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/10/opinion/mo-brooks-space-command.html', 'snippet': 'The congressman from Huntsville, Ala., was quick to claim that the 2020 election was stolen. His district continues to get special treatment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As uncommon as it is for the White House to worry about where the Pentagon puts its people and hardware, President Biden may need to follow the example of his predecessor and take a hard look at the site selection for U.S. Space Command. It tells a tale of two cities, Colorado Springs and Huntsville, Ala., and reveals a lot about our modern-day season of stunt guillotines and Trumpist revolutionaries.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/10/opinion/10mcw1/merlin_184693041_d30c2d39-6ba8-46c9-acc7-5e764ff53777-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/10/opinion/10mcw1/merlin_184693041_d30c2d39-6ba8-46c9-acc7-5e764ff53777-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/10/opinion/10mcw1/merlin_184693041_d30c2d39-6ba8-46c9-acc7-5e764ff53777-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/10/opinion/10mcw1/merlin_184693041_d30c2d39-6ba8-46c9-acc7-5e764ff53777-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': 