 'nyt://article/faca1e94-b121-54e7-b6e2-0ec124c2216a'}, {'abstract': 'In Chicago, groups of volunteers gave us a glimpse of a society where neighbors rely on one another.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/11/opinion/covid-mutual-aid-chicago.html', 'snippet': 'In Chicago, groups of volunteers gave us a glimpse of a society where neighbors rely on one another.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICAGO — “Free foooood!” It was a hot morning in late July, and many were gathered outside an elementary school to distribute groceries to the community. The D.J. played Beyoncé’s “Before I Let Go” as volunteers and people in line danced, six feet apart. Children of the neighborhood ran by to get snack packs and coloring books, and stayed to help elders carry their groceries. Regulars sat out in their chairs, just as they do every Monday.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/11/opinion/11covid-kjwaja-promo/11covid-kjwaja-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/11/opinion/11covid-kjwaja-promo/11covid-kjwaja-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/11/opinion/11covid-kjwaja-promo/11covid-kjwaja-promo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/11/opinion/11covid-kjwaja-promo/11covid-kjwaja-promo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/11/opinion/11covid