ened vials of vaccine at hospitals have gone to waste when doctors and nurses declined shots, news media have reported. In a country of 42 million, just over 23,000 people have received a dose.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/11/world/ukraine-covid-vaccine-misinformation.html', 'snippet': 'Opened vials of vaccine at hospitals have gone to waste when doctors and nurses declined shots, news media have reported. In a country of 42 million, just over 23,000 people have received a dose.', 'lead_paragraph': 'First Ukraine got caught up in the geopolitics of vaccine distribution between Russia and the West, and struggled to get hold of any doses. Now that it has them, Ukraine faces a new challenge: finding enough people who are willing to be vaccinated.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/10/us/10virus-briefing-ukraine-1/merlin_184824567_a3683da9-691d-44b4-8849-223f529f4b78-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/10/us/10virus-briefing-ukraine-1/merlin_184824567_a3683da9-691d-44b4-8849-223f529f4b78-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/10/us/10virus-briefing-ukraine-1/merlin_184824567_a3683da9-691d-44b4-8849-223f529f4b78-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/10/us/10virus-briefing-ukraine-1/merlin_184824567_a3683da9-691d-44b4-8849-223f529f4b78-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images