trouble for the Blue Devils will likely spark new skepticism of the N.C.A.A.’s plan to hold the national men’s basketball tournament next week in Indiana.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/11/sports/ncaabasketball/coronavirus-duke-acc-tournament.html', 'snippet': 'The trouble for the Blue Devils will likely spark new skepticism of the N.C.A.A.’s plan to hold the national men’s basketball tournament next week in Indiana.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The men’s basketball team at Duke University was one of the weaker teams in its conference. A freshman had decided in February to declare for the N.B.A. draft and not play the rest of the season. With a 13-11 record, the Blue Devils’ prospects for making the N.C.A.A. tournament were among their dimmest in decades.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/11/sports/11acc-duke/merlin_184865223_f74e9e4a-1383-4747-9eae-a14f0c5fe3df-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 411, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/11/sports/11acc-duke/merlin_184865223_f74e9e4a-1383-4747-9eae-a14f0c5fe3df-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 411}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/11/sports/11acc-duke/merlin_184865223_f74e9e4a-1383-4747-9eae-a14f0c5fe3df-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 701, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/11/sports/11acc-duke/merlin_184865223_f74e9e4a-1383-4747-9eae-a14f0c5fe3df-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1402, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021