-cb1c-50cf-bc22-89f06ba9d0e4', 'word_count': 1492, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2db74837-cb1c-50cf-bc22-89f06ba9d0e4'}, {'abstract': 'An Idaho state committee killed a bill that would have allowed the popular lottery to continue in the state even after it expanded to Australia and Britain.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/11/us/idaho-ends-powerball.html', 'snippet': 'An Idaho state committee killed a bill that would have allowed the popular lottery to continue in the state even after it expanded to Australia and Britain.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Idaho lawmakers moved on Wednesday to pull the state out of the Powerball lottery, setting an end to decades of participation in the popular game because of its plans to expand overseas.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/11/multimedia/11xp-powerball-image/11xp-powerball-image-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 358, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/11/multimedia/11xp-powerball-image/11xp-powerball-image-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 358}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/11/multimedia/11xp-powerball-image/11xp-powerball-image-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 612, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/11/multimedia/11xp-powerball-image/11xp-powerball-image-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1223, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/11/multimedia/11xp-powerball-image/11xp-powerball-image-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75