 a house the virus had narrowed from confining to claustrophobic. If the disease didn’t choke me, I worried that loneliness would. My children call every day and I speak by phone with a few close friends, but loneliness breeds in a silent house.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/12/science/12Ties-Muriel/12Ties-Muriel-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/12/science/12Ties-Muriel/12Ties-Muriel-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/12/science/12Ties-Muriel/12Ties-Muriel-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/12/science/12Ties-Muriel/12Ties-Muriel-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/12/science/12Ties-Muriel/12Ties-Muriel-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/12/science/12Ties-Muriel/12Ties-Muriel-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/12/science/12Ties-Muriel/12Ties-Muriel-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Hearing My Dead Wife’s Voice in the Pandemic’s Silence', 'kicker': 'Ties', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Quarantine (Life and Culture)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marriages', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Loneliness', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Grief (Emotion)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-03-12T10:00:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Well', 'section_name': 'Well', 'subsection_name': 'Family', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert W. Goldfarb', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Goldfarb', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/95817576-1f62-5d79-a104-691bff208b9f', 'word_count': 1240, 'uri': 'nyt://article/95817576-1f62-5d79-a104-691bff208b9f'}, {'abstract': 'Even with vaccines, the coronavirus won’t subside if we can’t keep tabs on it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/12/opinion/need-covid-tests.html', 'snippet': 'Even with vaccines, the coronavirus won’t subside if we can’t keep tabs on it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There’s reason for optimism on the coronavirus pandemic: The number of new Covid-19 cases is dropping, and 98.2 million doses of coronavirus vaccines have been administered in the United States. But a decline in the number of coronavirus tests being conducted threatens this progress, because those tests are vital to tracing the path and velocity of Covid-19.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/15/opinion/15nuzzopond/12nuzzopond-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/15/opinion/15nuzzopond/12nuzzopond-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/15/opinion/15nuzzopond/12nuzzopond-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/15/opinion/15nuzzopond/12nuzzopond-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/15/opinion/15nuzzopond/12nuzzopond-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/15/opinion/15nuzzopond/12nuzzopond-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/15/opinion/15nuzzopond/12nuzzopond-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Covid Vaccines Aren’t Enough. We Need More Tests.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Covid Vaccines Aren’t Enough. We Need More Tests.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vaccination and Immunization', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tests (Medical)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Disease Rates', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-03-12T10:00:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer B. Nuzzo and Emily N. Pond', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/0f1dbf3b-ba2d-58f5-b2ce-2f11d9db703b', 'word_count': 836, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0f1dbf3b-ba2d-58f5-b2ce-2f11d9db703b'}, {'abstract': 'There is more financial assistance for more people seeking coverage. And many people who are already covered can get discounts, too, if they sign up.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/12/upshot/need-health-insurance-a-guide-to-new-options-under-the-stimulus.html', 'snippet': 'There is more financial assistance for more people seeking coverage. And many people who are already covered can get discounts, too, if they sign up.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The stimulus package signed by President Biden on Thursday provides new options for Americans who need health insurance — and new resources to help lower costs for those who are already insured.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/12/upshot/12up-insurancefaq-1615499161656/12up-insurancefaq-1615499161656-articleLarge.png', 'height': 485, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/12/upshot/12up-insurancefaq-1615499161656/12up-insurancefaq-1615499161656-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 485}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/12/upshot/12up-insurancefaq-1615499161656/12up-insurancefaq-1615499161656-jumbo.png', 'height': 828, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/12/upshot/12up-insurance