ract': 'Since its inception in 1964, the Grammy for best album notes has been awarded to just three women. Davis, who won in 1993 for an Aretha Franklin boxed set, was the first.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/12/arts/music/thulani-davis-grammy-liner-notes.html', 'snippet': 'Since its inception in 1964, the Grammy for best album notes has been awarded to just three women. Davis, who won in 1993 for an Aretha Franklin boxed set, was the first.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If it’s Grammy season, it’s time for the annual attention paid to what many see as the Recording Academy’s longstanding and well-known diversity challenges, its preponderance for awarding Black artists in “niche” rather than mainstream categories, and its poor track record acknowledging the contributions of women across the board.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/12/arts/12grammys-davis2/merlin_182835948_44595944-b25e-4814-80a4-fea9df6d9fa4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 584, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/12/arts/12grammys-davis2/merlin_182835948_44595944-b25e-4814-80a4-fea9df6d9fa4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 584}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/12/arts/12grammys-davis2/merlin_182835948_44595944-b25e-4814-80a4-fea9df6d9fa4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 996, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/12/arts/12grammys-davis2/merlin_182835948_44595944-b25e-4814-80a4-fea9df6d9fa4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1993, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption':