_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/72374560-a41f-5136-96c4-99b040451a2a', 'word_count': 1635, 'uri': 'nyt://article/72374560-a41f-5136-96c4-99b040451a2a'}, {'abstract': 'About 17 states have made restaurant workers eligible for shots, compared to at least 26 that are vaccinating grocery workers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/12/world/covid-restaurants-vaccine.html', 'snippet': 'About 17 states have made restaurant workers eligible for shots, compared to at least 26 that are vaccinating grocery workers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'More and more of the United States has relaxed restrictions on indoor dining, but the number of states allowing workers in the restaurant industry to get a Covid-19 vaccine has been slow to rise.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/12/us/12virus-briefing-restaurant-workers/merlin_184683756_62697188-4734-4169-a4fc-8650a31f980a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/12/us/12virus-briefing-restaurant-workers/merlin_184683756_62697188-4734-4169-a4fc-8650a31f980a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/12/us/12virus-briefing-restaurant-workers/merlin_184683756_62697188-4734-4169-a4fc-8650a31f980a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/12/us/12virus-briefing-restaurant-workers/merlin_184683756_62697188-4734-4169-a4fc-8650a31f980a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image'