imes.com/2021/03/15/t-magazine/spring-design-architecture.html', 'snippet': 'Rebuilding, while a reminder of what’s been lost, is also a defiant act of hope.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When we were closing last year’s spring Design issue, it was the beginning of an era; now, 12 months later, we’re nearing its end. Of course, it’s not really the end, but on some days we’re able to pretend otherwise — we’re able to make plans again; we’re able to anticipate. Many of the crushing uncertainties we lived with for months have been answered (though in many cases, the answers are crushing, too).', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '40', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/15/t-magazine/15tmag-jojutla-slide-HPB9-copy/15tmag-jojutla-slide-HPB9-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/15/t-magazine/15tmag-jojutla-slide-HPB9-copy/15tmag-jojutla-slide-HPB9-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/15/t-magazine/15tmag-jojutla-slide-HPB9-copy/15tmag-jojutla-slide-HPB9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/15/t-magazine/15tmag-jojutla-slide-HPB9-copy/15tmag-jojutla-slide-HPB9-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/15/t-magazine/15tmag-jojutla-slide-HPB9-copy/15tmag-jojutla-slide-HPB9-copy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumb