i': 'nyt://article/82c430a6-3bdf-5d03-99f6-5e289fd8bd93'}, {'abstract': 'An early researcher of sleep disorders and the role of dreams in emotional health, she studied her subjects’ nights to help them turn their days around.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/15/obituaries/rosalind-cartwright-dead.html', 'snippet': 'An early researcher of sleep disorders and the role of dreams in emotional health, she studied her subjects’ nights to help them turn their days around.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 1999, Rosalind D. Cartwright, a renowned sleep researcher, testified for the defense in the murder trial of a man who arose from his bed early one night, gathered up tools to fix his pool’s filter pump, stabbed his beloved wife to death, rolled her into the pool and went back to bed. When he was awakened by the police, he said he had no memory of his actions.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/12/obituaries/Cartwright-01/merlin_184930806_aeadfa88-d278-4800-81f4-9bcffa7f1687-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/12/obituaries/Cartwright-01/merlin_184930806_aeadfa88-d278-4800-81f4-9bcffa7f1687-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/12/obituaries/Cartwright-01/merlin_184930806_aeadfa88-d278-4800-81f4-9bcffa7f1687-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 679, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/12/obituaries/Cartwright-01/merlin_184930806_aeadfa88-d278-4800-81f4-9bcffa7f1687-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1358, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJum