ans taking someone else’s spot in line — and more.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/16/magazine/additional-covid-vaccines.html', 'snippet': 'The magazine’s Ethicist columnist on whether securing a dose for yourself means taking someone else’s spot in line — and more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’m a college student, and I recently learned that my city is going to be opening up spots on the Health Department website for anyone to be vaccinated if there is a surplus of vaccines. We’re still in the first phase of vaccination, but if I were to look frequently at the vaccination website, I could in theory get an appointment.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/03/magazine/0321Mag-Ethicist-01/0321Mag-Ethicist-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 324, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/03/magazine/0321Mag-Ethicist-01/0321Mag-Ethicist-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 324}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/03/magazine/0321Mag-Ethicist-01/0321Mag-Ethicist-01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 553, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/03/magazine/0321Mag-Ethicist-01/0321Mag-Ethicist-01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1107, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/03/magazine/0321Mag-Ethicist-01/0321Mag-Ethicist-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/03/magazine/0321Mag-Ethicist-01