t casinos that lost big last year, the welcome mat is out.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For a fan, especially one who likes to gamble, there’s nothing quite like the atmosphere of a sports book during an N.C.A.A. basketball tournament. A packed house, multiple games on multiple televisions, throngs of fans enjoying a victory or tearing tickets in frustration at a defeat.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/17/sports/16ncaa-sportsbooks-print/merlin_152403423_d277154e-e33b-44de-a4bd-46ba4292df26-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/17/sports/16ncaa-sportsbooks-print/merlin_152403423_d277154e-e33b-44de-a4bd-46ba4292df26-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/17/sports/16ncaa-sportsbooks-print/merlin_152403423_d277154e-e33b-44de-a4bd-46ba4292df26-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/17/sports/16ncaa-sportsbooks-print/merlin_152403423_d277154e-e33b-44de-a4bd-46ba4292df26-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/17/sports/16ncaa-sportsbooks-print/16ncaa-sportsbooks-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/17/sports/16ncaa-sportsbooks-print/16ncaa-sportsbooks-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLa