ll go to the polls for its fourth national election in two years. The worst part is that this depressing Election Day may just be a prelude to yet another: Opinion polling suggests that Israel’s political blocs will struggle to elect and form a stable parliamentary majority. Our politics, it seems, are stuck on a repetitive doom loop.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/17/opinion/17rosner/17rosner-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/17/opinion/17rosner/17rosner-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/17/opinion/17rosner/17rosner-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/17/opinion/17rosner/17rosner-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/17/opinion/17rosner/17rosner-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/17/opinion/17rosner/17rosner-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/17/opinion/17rosner/17rosner-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s Missing in Israel’s Election? Biden.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s Missing in Israel’s Election? Biden.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Biden, Joseph R Jr', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Netanyahu, Benjamin', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-03-17T09:00:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Shmuel Rosner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Shmuel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rosner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/55cbf7b3-e9d2-50a3-bf4f-d44cfbed54f6', 'word_count': 948, 'uri': 'nyt://article/55cbf7b3-e9d2-50a3-bf4f-d44cfbed54f6'}, {'abstract': 'The clock was ticking. An M.R.I., a spinal tap and blood tests weren’t revealing the culprit. Could it be psychological?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/17/magazine/maple-syrup-urine-disease.html', 'snippet': 'The clock was ticking. An M.R.I., a spinal tap and blood tests weren’t revealing the culprit. Could it be psychological?', 'lead_paragraph': 'The 35-year-old man rose abruptly from the plastic chair in the waiting room at the Health Sciences Center Emergency Department in Winnipeg, Manitoba. He lurched toward the door, arms held stiffly before him as if warding off something only he could see. “I gotta get out of here,” he muttered. His eyes looked unfocused as he glanced at the family he didn’t seem to recognize. His mother hurried to his side. “It’s OK, Sean,” she murmured in his ear. “We’re here with you.” She took him over to his seat. And then, just as suddenly, he was back to normal, back to the man his family knew and loved. ', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/03/magazine/0321Mag-Diagnosis-01/0321Mag-Diagnosis-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 458, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/03/magazine/0321Mag-Diagnosis-01/0321Mag-Diagnosis-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 458}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/03/magazine/0321Mag-Diagnosis-01/0321Mag-Diagnosis-01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 781, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/03/magazine/0321Mag-Diagnosis-01/0321Mag-Diagnosis-01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1562, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/03/magazine/0321Mag-Diagnosis-01/0321Mag-Diagnosis-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/03/magazine/0321Mag-Diagnosis-01/0321Mag-Diagnosis-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/03/magazine/0321Mag-Diagnosis-01/0321Mag-Diagnosis-01-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'His Sister Died 12 Days After Suffering Mysterious Spells. Now He Had Them.', 'kicker': 'Diagnosis', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'His Sister Died 12 Days After Suffering Mysterious Spells. Now He Had Them.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tests (Medical)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Magnetic Resonance Imagers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Genetics and Heredity', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Psychiatry and Psychiatrists', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Proteins', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-03-17T09:00:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lisa Sanders, M.D', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lisa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sanders', 'qualifier': 'M.D', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6648722d-7c32-5bc3-a4e8-a513270e8676', 'word_count': 1447, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6648722d-7c32-5bc3-a4e8-a513270e8676'}, {'abstract': 'The shocking centerpiece to the new HBO documentary “Allen v. Farrow” shows how mothers struggle to be believed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/17/magazine/dylan-farrow-video.html', 'snippet': 'The shocking centerpiece to the new HBO documentary “Allen v. Farrow” shows how mothers struggle to be believed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A videotape awakens on a jumbled picture. The camera spins around a taupe interior as bars of static drift down the screen. A tipped-over room veers into view: a carpeted floor, the angle of a cracked door. Finally we rest on a polka-dot lump and a soft nest of hair. It’s a little girl. She is lying  facedown and speaking to her mother as if underwater. “He touched my privates, and then he was breathing on my leg,” the girl says. “He squeezed me too hard that I couldn’t breathe.” A telephone bleats, the camera jumps and for a moment we regard the girl’s face. Her eyes meet ours. A date stamped in a corner of the screen pins down Dylan Farrow like a butterfly: It is Aug. 5, 1992, and she is 7 years old. ', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/21/magazine/21mag-screenland/21mag-screenland-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/21/magazine/21mag-screenland/21mag-screenland-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/21/magazine/21mag-screenland/21mag-screenland-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/21/magazine/21mag-screenland/21mag-screenland-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/21/magazine/21mag-screenland/21mag-screenland-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/21/magazine/21mag-screenland/21mag-screenland-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/21/magazine/21mag-screenland/21mag-screenland-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What Does the Dylan Farrow Home Video Reveal?', 'kicker': 'Screenland', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Home Screen', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Child Abuse and Neglect', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ALLEN, WOODY', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Farrow, Mia', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Allen v Farrow (TV Program)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-03-17T09:00:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Amanda Hess', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Amanda', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hess', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4e1a9aa0-9a15-5db0-aae4-0a03b230d444', 'word_count': 1343, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4e1a9aa0-9a15-5db0-aae4-0a03b230d444'}, {'abstract': 'All the pleasure of the Nutty Buddy without the sugar overload.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/17/magazine/peanut-butter-cake-recipe.html', 'snippet': 'All the pleasure of the Nutty Buddy without the sugar overload.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I have almost no sweet tooth. My ideal dessert is a fat hunk of one of those blue cheeses that scratch the roof of your mouth and make your eyes water. All my pastry-chef friends have generously fielded my impossible questions over the years about the kinds of not-sweet sweets I wished I could create: Hi! I want to make granola bars but I want them to taste like Caesar salad. Any ideas? Hi, I’d like to make savory meringues with saffron and tomato paste, is that possible? Could plain, salted club-soda Jell-O work, or do I have to use sugar? I even make my go-to cocktail, a gin and tonic, without regular tonic: I use light tonic and a splash of plain seltzer, or as it’s called, a “gin and sonic.”', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/21/magazine/21mag-eat/21mag-eat-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 452, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/21/magazine/21mag-eat/21mag-eat-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 452}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/21/magazine/21mag-eat/21mag-eat-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 771, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/21/magazine/21mag-eat/21mag-eat-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1541, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/21/magazine/21mag-eat/21mag-eat-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/21/magazine/21mag-eat/21mag-eat-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/21/magazine/21mag-eat/21mag-eat-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Luscious Peanut-Butter Wafer Cake That Won’t Give You a Toothache', 'kicker': 'Eat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Luscious Peanut-Butter Wafer Cake That Won’t Give You a Toothache', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'