', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nancy Hass', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nancy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hass', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9fb6ce04-f81a-5937-9729-070cdce61f44', 'word_count': 207, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9fb6ce04-f81a-5937-9729-070cdce61f44'}, {'abstract': 'A John Lautner-designed showplace in the Hollywood Hills; a waterfront home in Darien, Conn.; and a contemporary house on Puget Sound in Seattle.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2021/03/17/realestate/what-you-get-for-2-8-million-in-california-connecticut-and-washington.html', 'snippet': 'A John Lautner-designed showplace in the Hollywood Hills; a waterfront home in Darien, Conn.; and a contemporary house on Puget Sound in Seattle.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A John Lautner-designed showplace in the Hollywood Hills; a waterfront home in Darien, Conn.; and a contemporary house on Puget Sound in Seattle.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/21/realestate/17WYG-slide-LQHT/17WYG-slide-LQHT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/21/realestate/17WYG-slide-LQHT/17WYG-slide-LQHT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/21/realestate/17WYG-slide-LQHT/17WYG-slide-LQHT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/21/realestate/17WYG-slide-LQHT/17WYG-slide-LQHT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1359, 'width': 2048, 'subType': '