 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/82fd8b91-9e32-5979-a3f7-f9ee7c58648c', 'word_count': 356, 'uri': 'nyt://article/82fd8b91-9e32-5979-a3f7-f9ee7c58648c'}, {'abstract': 'The Federal Reserve’s economic estimates show rates at near zero for years, along with faster growth and higher inflation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/17/business/economy/fed-projects-patience-even-as-economic-outlook-brightens.html', 'snippet': 'The Federal Reserve’s economic estimates show rates at near zero for years, along with faster growth and higher inflation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Federal Reserve officials signaled on Wednesday that they are in no rush to dial back support for a pandemic-damaged economy, releasing a fresh set of projections that showed the central bank’s policy interest rate on hold at near zero for years to come — even as the outlook rapidly improves.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Fed Projects Patience Even as Economic Outlook Brightens', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fed Projects Patience Even as Economic Outlook Brightens', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interest Rates', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Inflation (Economics)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Reserve System', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-03-17T18:01:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeanna Smialek', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeanna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Smialek', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/05eec967-0b6f-5d78-8e44-74f4ea6095fe', 'word_count': 1169, 'uri': 'nyt://article/05eec967-0b6f-5d78-8e44-74f4ea6095fe'}, {'abstract': 'Players said the lawyer for the N.F.L. retiree class knew that race-based criteria were used to deny Black players’ dementia claims. A review of eight such rejections seems to support their argument.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/17/sports/football/nfl-concussion-settlement-race-bias.html', 'snippet': 'Players said the lawyer for the N.F.L. retiree class knew that race-based criteria were used to deny Black players’ dementia claims. A review of eight such rejections seems to support their argument.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two retired N.F.L. players who have filed dementia-related claims in the N.F.L. concussion settlement, and have accused the league of discriminating against Black players, want their own representative to attend a mediation aimed at addressing the use of race-based benchmarks to determine eligibility for payouts.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/17/sports/17nfl-settle-1/merlin_172325622_86d7d703-cc14-4c9a-adee-1aabc14c3295-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/17/sports/17nfl-settle-1/merlin_172325622_86d7d703-cc14-4c9a-adee-1aabc14c3295-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/17/sports/17nfl-settle-1/merlin_172325622_86d7d703-cc14-4c9a-adee-1aabc14c3295-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None,