ws', '_id': 'nyt://article/beaefa89-9176-5d91-9e9e-b9fa308d4291', 'word_count': 1182, 'uri': 'nyt://article/beaefa89-9176-5d91-9e9e-b9fa308d4291'}, {'abstract': 'Congress should consider a targeted federal law to slow the march of restrictive state laws.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/18/opinion/republicans-voting-rights.html', 'snippet': 'Congress should consider a targeted federal law to slow the march of restrictive state laws.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Republican-dominated state legislatures around the country have responded to the cynical calls from Donald Trump for “election reform” with an array of proposals to restrict voting rights. They include limiting early-voting opportunities, constraining access to vote-by-mail and imposing more voter identification and other requirements to protect against what Mr. Trump falsely claimed to be “a level of dishonesty” that “is not to be believed.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/18/opinion/18Bauer1/18Bauer1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 402, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/18/opinion/18Bauer1/18Bauer1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 402}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/18/opinion/18Bauer1/18Bauer1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 686, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/18/opinion/18Bauer1/18Bauer1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1373, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/18/opinion/18Bauer1/18Bauer1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 