sing to the Challenge of China', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rising to the Challenge of China', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Trade and World Market', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Customs (Tariff)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computer Chips', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Biden, Joseph R Jr', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Taiwan', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-03-18T09:00:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Farah Stockman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Farah', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stockman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/d43c58b9-d267-5c95-8f28-4ddb5beb0401', 'word_count': 1146, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d43c58b9-d267-5c95-8f28-4ddb5beb0401'}, {'abstract': 'Young adults and the elderly were especially isolated in the pandemic. There are efforts underway to help connect them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/18/well/family/lonely-generations-young-adults-seniors.html', 'snippet': 'Young adults and the elderly were especially isolated in the pandemic. There are efforts underway to help connect them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Th