e guards and even panic rooms.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/19/sports/soccer/di-maria-marquinhos-psg-robberies.html', 'snippet': 'A string of robberies at the homes of soccer stars has cast a spotlight on the wealthy athlete’s newest luxury items: protection dogs, private guards and even panic rooms.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ángel Di María got the news as soon as he stepped off the field. Pulling him in the middle of a tie game appeared to make little sense, but Paris St.-Germain’s coach quickly provided an explanation: Di María’s wife had called the team’s security officer. He needed to get home immediately. His family’s house had just been robbed.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/19/sports/19soccer-robberies/merlin_185067474_dafb990d-5ce3-47c2-9a04-db6859c7a154-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/19/sports/19soccer-robberies/merlin_185067474_dafb990d-5ce3-47c2-9a04-db6859c7a154-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/19/sports/19soccer-robberies/merlin_185067474_dafb990d-5ce3-47c2-9a04-db6859c7a154-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/19/sports/19soccer-robberies/merlin_185067474_dafb990d-5ce3-47c2-9a04-db6859c7a154-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/19/sports/19soccer-robberies/19soccer-robberies-thumbStandard.jpg'