ficial way to stream the tournament is through the N.C.A.A.’s March Madness Live app, which requires logging in through a TV provider. (The Paramount+ app, formerly known as CBS All Access, will also carry games broadcast on CBS.)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/19/sports/19ncaa-marchmadness-stream/merlin_185167803_e1bef183-63ff-49a2-9299-6ee877d0aec0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/19/sports/19ncaa-marchmadness-stream/merlin_185167803_e1bef183-63ff-49a2-9299-6ee877d0aec0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/19/sports/19ncaa-marchmadness-stream/merlin_185167803_e1bef183-63ff-49a2-9299-6ee877d0aec0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/19/sports/19ncaa-marchmadness-stream/merlin_185167803_e1bef183-63ff-49a2-9299-6ee877d0aec0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/19/sports/19ncaa-marchmadness-stream/merlin_185167803_e1bef183-63ff-49a2-9299-6ee877d0aec0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/19/sports/19ncaa-marchmadness-stream/merlin_185167803_e1bef183-63ff-49a2-9299-6ee877d0aec0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/19/sports/19nca