 'nyt://article/0b382077-c9df-5b47-b849-36b6e9ec7055'}, {'abstract': 'Despite warnings, American and European officials gave up leverage that could have guaranteed access for billions of people. That risks prolonging the pandemic.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/21/world/vaccine-patents-us-eu.html', 'snippet': 'Despite warnings, American and European officials gave up leverage that could have guaranteed access for billions of people. That risks prolonging the pandemic.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the coming days, a patent will finally be issued on a five-year-old invention, a feat of molecular engineering that is at the heart of at least five major Covid-19 vaccines. And the United States government will control that patent.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/21/world/xxVACCINE-IP1/merlin_184877346_b59a5804-ff16-4ce4-b503-5ca2b95ba768-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/21/world/xxVACCINE-IP1/merlin_184877346_b59a5804-ff16-4ce4-b503-5ca2b95ba768-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/21/world/xxVACCINE-IP1/merlin_184877346_b59a5804-ff16-4ce4-b503-5ca2b95ba768-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/21/world/xxVACCINE-IP1/merlin_184877346_b59a5804-ff16-4ce4-b503-5ca2b95ba768-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/21/world/xxVACCI