s itself.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/22/business/biden-coronavirus-stimulus.html', 'snippet': 'The White House is setting benchmarks, such as a 4 percent unemployment rate, to mark a full recovery. But the wild card remains the same: the virus itself.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Biden administration, with hundreds of billions of dollars to spend to end the Covid crisis, has set a series of aggressive benchmarks to determine whether the economy has fully recovered, including returning to historically low unemployment and helping more than one million Black and Hispanic women return to work within a year.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/21/us/politics/21dc-virus-stimulus-1/merlin_185125356_ee6ae2de-2927-4ae0-8988-4de0ed37fde6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/21/us/politics/21dc-virus-stimulus-1/merlin_185125356_ee6ae2de-2927-4ae0-8988-4de0ed37fde6-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/21/us/politics/21dc-virus-stimulus-1/merlin_185125356_ee6ae2de-2927-4ae0-8988-4de0ed37fde6-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/21/us/politics/21dc-virus-stimulus-1/merlin_185125356_ee6ae2de-2927-4ae0-8988-4de0ed37fde6-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/21/us/politics/21dc-virus-stimulus-1/merlin_185125356_ee6ae2de-2