i': 'nyt://article/f5c64f70-4f1c-5cda-9f7f-c5cb21fc0666'}, {'abstract': 'Immigrant entrepreneurs are working with designers and brand strategists to create packaging that appeals to a wider range of consumers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/22/business/ethnic-foods-packaging-entrepreneurship.html', 'snippet': 'Immigrant entrepreneurs are working with designers and brand strategists to create packaging that appeals to a wider range of consumers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Fonio, a cereal grain imported from West Africa, was once relegated to the shelves of tiny grocery stores frequented by immigrants primarily from Senegal and Mali. But it has gradually made its way to Whole Foods, where pouches decorated with a painted map of Africa are nestled amid packages of rice and lentils, aimed at a broader range of American consumers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/18/business/18ethnic-foods-01/18ethnic-foods-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/18/business/18ethnic-foods-01/18ethnic-foods-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 480}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/18/business/18ethnic-foods-01/18ethnic-foods-01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/18/business/18ethnic-foods-01/18ethnic-foods-01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1638, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/18/business/18ethnic-foods-01/18ethnic-foods-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'he