at its ridership may never return entirely threatens its future.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/22/nyregion/nyc-subway-coronavirus.html', 'snippet': 'Billions of dollars in federal aid have pulled New York’s transit agency from the depths of its fiscal crisis. But a growing consensus that its ridership may never return entirely threatens its future.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the coronavirus engulfed New York City early last year, Adrienne Crespo, a subway conductor, watched the crowds on the platforms slowly thin out. Then one afternoon, she pulled an A train into the West Fourth Street-Washington Square station — typically one of the busiest on her line — and saw only two people board.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/09/nyregion/00nyvirus-mta-02-PROMO/00nyvirus-mta-02-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/09/nyregion/00nyvirus-mta-02-PROMO/00nyvirus-mta-02-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/09/nyregion/00nyvirus-mta-02-PROMO/00nyvirus-mta-02-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/09/nyregion/00nyvirus-mta-02-PROMO/00nyvirus-mta-02-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/09/nyregion/00nyvirus-mta-02-PROMO/00nyvirus-mta-02-PROMO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStan