t': 'Millions of older Americans, chronically ill and trapped at home, pose a big challenge to inoculation efforts. Doctors are on it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/22/health/virus-seniors-vaccination.html', 'snippet': 'Millions of older Americans, chronically ill and trapped at home, pose a big challenge to inoculation efforts. Doctors are on it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One vial of vaccine. Five elderly homebound patients. Six hours to get to them before the vaccine spoiled.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/22/science/00VIRUS-HOMEBOUND-promo/00VIRUS-HOMEBOUND-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/22/science/00VIRUS-HOMEBOUND-promo/00VIRUS-HOMEBOUND-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/22/science/00VIRUS-HOMEBOUND-promo/00VIRUS-HOMEBOUND-promo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/22/science/00VIRUS-HOMEBOUND-promo/00VIRUS-HOMEBOUND-promo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/22/science/00VIRUS-HOMEBOUND-promo/00VIRUS-HOMEBOUND-promo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/22/science/00VIRUS-HOMEBOUND-promo/00VIRUS-HOMEBOUND-promo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, '