 the bikes were spaced at least six feet apart. (At the time, the gym didn’t require people to wear masks.)', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/28/well/22well-groupexercise-promo/22well-groupexercise-promo-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/28/well/22well-groupexercise-promo/22well-groupexercise-promo-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/28/well/22well-groupexercise-promo/22well-groupexercise-promo-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/28/well/22well-groupexercise-promo/22well-groupexercise-promo-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/28/well/22well-groupexercise-promo/22well-groupexercise-promo-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/28/well/22well-groupexercise-promo/22well-groupexercise-promo-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/28/well/22well-groupexercise-promo/22well-groupexercise-promo-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Is It Safe to Go Back to Group Exercise Class at the Gym?', 'kicker': 'ask well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Seeking Safety at Indoor Fitness Classes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Exercise', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus Risks and Safety Concerns', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Content Type: Service', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fans (Airflow)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Clubs', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hygiene and Cleanliness', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Masks', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-03-22T19:20:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Well', 'section_name': 'Well', 'subsection_name': 'Move', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tara Parker-Pope and Gretchen Reynolds', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tara', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Parker-Pope', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Gretchen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Reynolds', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/56071532-6b3a-5b7b-bb7e-6f6019922a6a', 'word_count': 2216, 'uri': 'nyt://article/56071532-6b3a-5b7b-bb7e-6f6019922a6a'}, {'abstract': 'The justices considered a California regulation that allowed labor representatives to meet with farm workers at their worksites for up to three hours a day for as many as 120 days a year.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/22/us/supreme-court-union-organizers-private-property.html', 'snippet': 'The justices considered a California regulation that allowed labor representatives to meet with farm workers at their worksites for up to three hours a day for as many 