': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6cca471c-fe84-509c-8ea7-32e4635afcf6', 'word_count': 713, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6cca471c-fe84-509c-8ea7-32e4635afcf6'}, {'abstract': 'Jaisalmer India Craft Gin, newly available in the United States, is pleasant alone, or mingling with mixers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/22/dining/jaisalmer-india-craft-gin.html', 'snippet': 'Jaisalmer India Craft Gin, newly available in the United States, is pleasant alone, or mingling with mixers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There’s an Indian gin, new to the United States, that’s worth knowing. Jaisalmer Indian Craft Gin, made by one of India’s major distillers, Radico Khaitan, offers a dry, aromatic style, with piney, minty, citric notes and a hint of coriander and anise on the palate, to pair well with tonic or in a martini. At the same time it is extremely well-balanced and delightful neat or on the rocks. The gin starts with a triple-distilled neutral spirit which is then redistilled with botanicals in copper pot stills in Rampur in Uttar Pradesh.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/24/dining/22burner-gin/merlin_185159853_2de41ca2-3c39-47ac-8906-3de32c3060b5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 801, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/24/dining/22burner-gin/merlin_185159853_2de41ca2-3c39-47ac-8906-3de32c3060b5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 801}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/24/dining/22burner-gin/merlin_185159853_2de41ca2-3c39-47ac-8906-3de32c3060b5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/24/dining/22burner-gin/merlin_185159853_2de41ca2-3c39-47ac-8906-3de32c3060b5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1535, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/24/dining/22burner-gin/22burner-gin-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/24/dining/22burner-gin/22burner-gin-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/24/dining/22burner-gin/22burner-gin-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Delightful Neat or on the Rocks', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Sip: Delightful Neat Or on the Rocks', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gin (Liquor)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Delhi (India)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-03-22T20:35:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/41cd5a91-9d96-57fd-80c1-dd05bd2995e8', 'word_count': 126, 'uri': 'nyt://article/41cd5a91-9d96-57fd-80c1-dd05bd2995e8'}, {'abstract': 'Culatta is made south of Parma, from a boneless thigh, the same cut used for culatello.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/22/dining/culatta-prosciutto.html', 'snippet': 'Culatta is made south of Parma, from a boneless thigh, the same cut used for culatello.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Italy offers many types of prosciutto, from different regions and also from several cuts of pork. Culatta is one of them, new to the American market, and made from a central, most tender part of the boneless thigh. It’s the same cut as is used for the highly prized culatello prosciutto except that for culatta, the rind is retained to insulate the silky, sweetly salted meat. It’s usually made in a small area south of Parma; culatello is made to the northeast.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/24/dining/22burner-proscuitto/22burner-proscuitto-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/24/dining/22burner-proscuitto/22burner-proscuitto-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/24/dining/22burner-proscuitto/22burner-proscuitto-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/24/dining/22burner-proscuitto/22burner-proscuitto-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/24/dining/22burner-proscuitto/22burner-proscuitto-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/24/dining/22burner-proscuitto/22burner-proscuitto-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/24/dining/22burner-proscuitto/22burner-proscuitto-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'An Italian Prosciutto Makes Its American Debut', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Savor: An Italian Prosciutto Makes Its American Debut', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Meat', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ham', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Parma (Italy)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-03-22T20:38:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fe6f850b-fc9f-5a57-8455-c19664b5f54d', 'word_count': 114, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fe6f850b-fc9f-5a57-8455-c19664b5f54d'}, {'abstract': 'Whipped-Urban Dessert Lab, run by the sisters Courtney Blagrove and Zan B.R., is expanding its hours and introducing pints.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/22/dining/oat-milk-ice-cream-whipped-urban-dessert-lab.html', 'snippet': 'Whipped-Urban Dessert Lab, run by the sisters Courtney Blagrove and Zan B.R., is expanding its hours and introducing pints.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Creamy oat milk soft-serve “ice cream” in chocolate, vanilla or a swirl of both (starting at $5.75), is dispensed into big cones or cups and garnished with sauces, sprinkles and other toppings at Whipped, a storefront on the Lower East Side. The owners, sisters Zan B.R., a lawyer, and Courtney Blagrove, with a degree in nutrition and metabolism, started with a pop-up in Williamsburg, Brooklyn, selling what they say is the first oat milk soft-serve. About a year ago they opened the shop on a limited basis, weekends only, because of the pandemic. Soon they plan to extend the schedule. Now, to increase their audience, they are introducing Oaté Modern Ice Crème, in 14-ounce containers at the end of the month. They also sell a version layered with sauce and toppings in cute half-pint boxes, $8, and $99 for six on goldbelly.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/24/dining/22Burner-Oat/merlin_185039667_998eeb9a-9d72-453d-8dd2-d35442ea51e0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/24/dining/22Burner-Oat/merlin_185039667_998eeb9a-9d72-453d-8dd2-d35442ea51e0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/24/dining/22Burner-Oat/merlin_185039667_998eeb9a-9d72-453d-8dd2-d35442ea51e0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/24/dining/22Burner-Oat/merlin_185039667_998eeb9a-9d72-453d-8dd2-d35442ea51e0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/24/dining/22Burner-Oat/22Burner-Oat-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/24/dining/22Burner-Oat/22Burner-Oat-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'su