at he wants Republicans who opposed his election falsehoods to pay politically.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/22/us/politics/jody-hice-raffensperger-trump-georgia.html', 'snippet': 'By supporting a challenger to Georgia’s current secretary of state, Brad Raffensperger, the former president signaled that he wants Republicans who opposed his election falsehoods to pay politically.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Former President Donald J. Trump on Monday took aim at a Georgia official he considers one of his biggest enemies: Secretary of State Brad Raffensperger, who refused Mr. Trump’s pressure to overturn the state’s election results last year.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/22/us/politics/22trump-georgia/merlin_175037406_ecba1dd5-1d7e-43d4-99c1-22f4c13dc367-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/22/us/politics/22trump-georgia/merlin_175037406_ecba1dd5-1d7e-43d4-99c1-22f4c13dc367-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/22/us/politics/22trump-georgia/merlin_175037406_ecba1dd5-1d7e-43d4-99c1-22f4c13dc367-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/22/us/politics/22trump-georgia/merlin_175037406_ecba1dd5-1d7e-43d4-99c1-22f4c13dc367-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/22/us/politics/22trump-georgia/22trump-georgia-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbn