71b7231f695d'}, {'abstract': 'Mayor Francis Suarez is selling his city as the world’s cryptocurrency capital.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/23/business/dealbook/miami-suarez-crypto.html', 'snippet': 'Mayor Francis Suarez is selling his city as the world’s cryptocurrency capital.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mayor Francis Suarez of Miami is selling his city as the world’s cryptocurrency capital. “We want to be on the next wave of innovation,” he told DealBook. To make that happen, Mr. Suarez said he was “refashioning” the city’s “fun in the sun” image. Thanks in part to the mayor’s marketing efforts, tech and finance titans have flocked to Miami during the pandemic.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/23/business/23db-newsletter-miami/merlin_184215318_a616c3ea-2b44-4a6a-9615-6356e9438609-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 394, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/23/business/23db-newsletter-miami/merlin_184215318_a616c3ea-2b44-4a6a-9615-6356e9438609-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 394}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/23/business/23db-newsletter-miami/merlin_184215318_a616c3ea-2b44-4a6a-9615-6356e9438609-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 673, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/23/business/23db-newsletter-miami/merlin_184215318_a616c3ea-2b44-4a6a-9615-6356e9438609-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1345, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/23/business/23db-newsletter-miami/merlin_184215318_a616c3ea-2b44-4a6a-9615-6