l-booking site, weekly booking volume has increased by 75 percent in the last month. In a recent survey of nearly 2,800 clients, Travel Leaders Network, a North American consortium of travel advisers, found that those who are vaccinated are 20 percent more likely than their unvaccinated peers to have a vacation booked.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/29/travel/24vaccine-and-travel-print/merlin_185119965_1973d966-1ab3-4600-8a85-e97c8cd9bc27-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/29/travel/24vaccine-and-travel-print/merlin_185119965_1973d966-1ab3-4600-8a85-e97c8cd9bc27-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/29/travel/24vaccine-and-travel-print/merlin_185119965_1973d966-1ab3-4600-8a85-e97c8cd9bc27-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/29/travel/24vaccine-and-travel-print/merlin_185119965_1973d966-1ab3-4600-8a85-e97c8cd9bc27-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/29/travel/24vaccine-and-travel-print/merlin_185119965_1973d966-1ab3-4600-8a85-e97c8cd9bc27-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/29/travel/24vaccine-and-travel-print/merlin_185119965_1973d966-1ab3-4600-8a85-e97c8cd9bc27-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 