cle/14f0759d-10c9-59ea-8784-56f96952de2d'}, {'abstract': 'From oddball genre movies to complex indie dramas, recommendations to help you get creative with your home viewing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/23/movies/colossal-the-past-offbeat-streaming-options.html', 'snippet': 'From oddball genre movies to complex indie dramas, recommendations to help you get creative with your home viewing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Are we in the final months of stuck-at-home viewing? The vaccination rates would certainly seem to indicate as much, but with positivity rates still worryingly high, your home theater is still the safest bet, even if it seems like you’re running out of streaming options. If so, we can recommend a group of oddball genre movies, a handful of complex indie dramas, and a documentary about art forgers and the deep-pocketed victims they took for a pricey ride.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/04/07/movies/beyond1-colossal/beyond1-colossal-articleLarge-v6.jpg', 'height': 327, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/04/07/movies/beyond1-colossal/beyond1-colossal-articleLarge-v6.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 327}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/04/07/movies/beyond1-colossal/beyond1-colossal-jumbo-v6.jpg', 'height': 558, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/04/07/movies/beyond1-colossal/beyond1-colossal-superJumbo-v6.jpg', 'height': 869, 'width': 1596, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/04/07/movies/beyond1-colossal/beyond1