ater.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/23/arts/david-mccabe-dead.html', 'snippet': 'In 1964, he began following the artist around New York and chronicling his exploits. His photographs finally saw the light of day four decades later.', 'lead_paragraph': 'David McCabe, a photographer who was given the assignment of a lifetime in 1964 when Andy Warhol hired him to follow him around New York and chronicle his exploits for a year, thereby participating in the manufacturing of Warhol’s public image and the enduring myth of downtown New York, died on Feb. 26 at a hospital in Albany, N.Y. He was 80.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/31/obituaries/McCabe-01/McCabe-01-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 406, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/31/obituaries/McCabe-01/McCabe-01-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 406}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/31/obituaries/McCabe-01/McCabe-01-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 693, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/31/obituaries/McCabe-01/McCabe-01-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1387, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/31/obituaries/McCabe-01/McCabe-01-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/31/obituaries/McCabe-01/McCabe-01-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 't