-55ce-9c24-bfbfb215d7e8', 'word_count': 1791, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3b97be23-7e06-55ce-9c24-bfbfb215d7e8'}, {'abstract': 'Turner and McConnell of the Indiana Pacers lead the N.B.A. in blocks (Turner) and steals (McConnell), a rare feat for teammates and a headache for everyone else.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/23/sports/basketball/myles-turner-pacers.html', 'snippet': 'Turner and McConnell of the Indiana Pacers lead the N.B.A. in blocks (Turner) and steals (McConnell), a rare feat for teammates and a headache for everyone else.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In some obvious ways, Myles Turner and T.J. McConnell couldn’t be more different as basketball players. Turner is a 6-foot-11 center who does much of his finest work above the rim. McConnell is a 6-foot-1 point guard who plays a more earthbound brand of the game. Turner swats shots, while McConnell picks pockets. One is an ominous presence in the paint; the other, a self-described “pest” who roams the perimeter.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/23/sports/23nba-pacers-defense-1/merlin_181896057_84e9eade-2076-47b0-a2b3-6221201d1b18-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/23/sports/23nba-pacers-defense-1/merlin_181896057_84e9eade-2076-47b0-a2b3-6221201d1b18-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/23/sports/23nba-pacers-defense-1/merlin_181896057_84e9eade-2076-47b0-a2b3-6221201d1b18-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/23/sports/23nba-pacers-defense-1/merlin_181896057_84e9eade-2076-47b0-a2b3-6221201d1b18-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/23/sports/23nba-pacers-defense-1/23nba-pacers-defense-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/23/sports/23nba-pacers-defense-1/23nba-pacers-defense-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/23/sports/23nba-pacers-defense-1/23nba-pacers-defense-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Myles Turner Will Block Your Shot. If T.J. McConnell Doesn’t Pick Your Pocket First.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With Blocks and Steals, Two Pacers Create a Safety Net', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Indiana Pacers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Turner, Myles (1996- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McConnell, Timothy John (1992- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Content Type: Personal Profile', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-03-23T20:04:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Scott Cacciola', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Scott', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cacciola', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/61aa085c-73ec-5011-88f7-487915ca7dab', 'word_count': 1238, 'uri': 'nyt://article/61aa085c-73ec-5011-88f7-487915ca7dab'}, {'abstract': 'After one of the closest contests in American history, the House must now decide whether to unseat Mariannette Miller-Meeks, a Republican.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/23/us/politics/house-iowa-election.html', 'snippet': 'After one of the closest contests in American history, the House must now decide whether to unseat Mariannette Miller-Meeks, a Republican.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Three months after its count of the presidential election results set off a riot at the Capitol, Congress has plunged once again into a red-hot dispute over the 2020 balloting, this time weighing whether to overturn the results of a House race in Iowa that could tilt the chamber’s narrow balance of power.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/23/us/politics/23dc-iowa/23dc-iowa-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/23/us/politics/23dc-iowa/23dc-iowa-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/23/us/politics/23dc-iowa/23dc-iowa-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/23/us/politics/23dc-iowa/23dc-iowa-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/23/us/politics/23dc-iowa/23dc-iowa-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType