 vetted and evaluated every year and reads like a who’s who of aspirational travel. “As of March 8, 2021, Trump Hotels are no longer part of the Virtuoso network,” a spokeswoman said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/23/business/trump-hotels-virtuoso.html', 'snippet': 'The network’s list of hotel partners is vetted and evaluated every year and reads like a who’s who of aspirational travel. “As of March 8, 2021, Trump Hotels are no longer part of the Virtuoso network,” a spokeswoman said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Virtuoso, a global network of luxury travel advisers, has dropped Trump Hotels from its list of hotel partners and will no longer offer the 10 hotels that operate under the Trump brand as an option to its high-end clients.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/23/business/23economy-briefing-trumphotel/merlin_177388260_79c85910-33cc-41c8-a3b3-2d9752b11fdc-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/23/business/23economy-briefing-trumphotel/merlin_177388260_79c85910-33cc-41c8-a3b3-2d9752b11fdc-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/23/business/23economy-briefing-trumphotel/merlin_177388260_79c85910-33cc-41c8-a3b3-2d9752b11fdc-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/23/business/23economy-briefing-trumphotel/merlin_177388260_79c85910-33cc-41c8-a3b3-2d9752b11fdc-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image',