'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voter Fraud (Election Fraud)', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2020', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 16, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-03-24T20:45:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Politics', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nick Corasaniti', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Corasaniti', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0f71f9e7-1a70-5cab-a660-8d7daedca60a', 'word_count': 1653, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0f71f9e7-1a70-5cab-a660-8d7daedca60a'}, {'abstract': 'Researchers are just beginning to untangle how Covid might be linked to a ringing in the ears. Here’s what we know.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/article/covid-symptoms-ears-ringing.html', 'snippet': 'Researchers are just beginning to untangle how Covid might be linked to a ringing in the ears. Here’s what we know.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Shortly after she fell ill with Covid-19 last April, Andrea Ceresa, an office manager and singer in Branchburg, N.J., noticed an unusual sensation in her ears: a ringing and buzzing that had never been present before. Now, nearly a year later, Ms. Ceresa, 47, said that of all the debilitating post-Covid symptoms that have lingered — the heart palpitations, headaches, stomach troubles, numbness and weakness in her hands and feet — the most frustrating one is the tinnitus, a condition that can cause sufferers to hear phantom ringing, buzzing, whistling, chirping or other sounds.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank'