e 1960s — his writing was banned for a time — he found wider fame as an exile in Paris and taught in the U.S.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/24/books/adam-zagajewski-dead.html', 'snippet': 'A dissident in Communist Poland in the late 1960s — his writing was banned for a time — he found wider fame as an exile in Paris and taught in the U.S.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Adam Zagajewski, a prizewinning Polish poet and a former dissident in exile whose life and verse reverberated with laments over displacement and reminders that the past perseveres, died on March 21 in Krakow, Poland. He was 75.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/25/obituaries/23Zagajewski2/23Zagajewski2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 675, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/25/obituaries/23Zagajewski2/23Zagajewski2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 675}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/25/obituaries/23Zagajewski2/23Zagajewski2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 911, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/25/obituaries/23Zagajewski2/23Zagajewski2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1821, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/25/obituaries/23Zagajewski2/23Zagajewski2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/25/obituaries/23Zagajewski2/23Zagajewski2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'