h party Volt misstated the year in which it was founded. It was established in 2017, not 2016. An earlier version also referred imprecisely to its founders. It was established by Andrea Venzon, Colombe Cahen-Salvador and Damian Boeselager, not by Mr. Venzon alone.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: March 25, 2021', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2021-03-25T02:48:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Corrections', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Correction', '_id': 'nyt://article/dfeeb42e-9de6-55ae-8520-cc4cceec504f', 'word_count': 167, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dfeeb42e-9de6-55ae-8520-cc4cceec504f'}, {'abstract': 'Italy’s vaccine missteps.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/24/briefing/vaccinations-italy-myanmar-israel-election.html', 'snippet': 'Italy’s vaccine missteps.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bureaucratic hurdles and logistical problems have undercut vaccination efforts in Italy, preventing older and vulnerable Italians from getting shots, while hundreds of doses of Covid vaccines are at risk of going to waste.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/25/us/25EUROPE-BRIEFING-NL-italy/merlin_185399574_d9a20766-8e3d-4807-a7cd-bfd7735c5eaa-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/25/us/25EUROPE-BRIEFING-NL-italy/merlin_185399574_d9a20766-8e3d-4807-a7cd-bfd7735c5eaa-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/25/us/25EUROPE-BRIEFING-NL-ital