bo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/23/arts/badtrip1/merlin_185254485_a202cb29-160d-4ffc-b9e7-d3116ff921c8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1107, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/23/arts/badtrip1/badtrip1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/23/arts/badtrip1/badtrip1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/23/arts/badtrip1/badtrip1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Bad Trip’ Review: On the Road, Leaking Fluid', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bad Trip', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Andre, Eric', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Howery, Lil Rel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Haddish, Tiffany', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Bad Trip (Movie)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sakurai, Kitao', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-03-25T11:00:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeannette Catsoulis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeannette', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Catsoulis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/5365e628-98eb-5e01-88a7-75375ffa6d33', 'word_count': 266, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5365e628-98eb-5e01-88a7-75375ffa6d33'}, {'abstract': 'Bob Odenkirk plays a family man with a secret past in this slick, shallow thriller.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/25/movies/nobody-review.html', 'snippet': 'Bob Odenkirk plays a family man with a secret past in this slick, shallow thriller.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As slick as a blood spill and as single-minded as a meat grinder, “Nobody” hustles us along with a swiftness that blurs the foolishness of its plot and the depravity of its message. A series of cartoonishly rapid cuts introduces Hutch (Bob Odenkirk), a mild-mannered suburban schmuck whose identical days flip past in a haze of chores and a vague desk job. His sighing wife (Connie Nielsen) and teenage son (Gage Munroe) regard him with something close to pity — especially when he balks at attacking two luckless home invaders. His son is fearless; Hutch is frozen.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/24/arts/nobody1/nobody1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/24/arts/nobody1/nobody1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/24/arts/nobody1/nobody1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/24/arts/nobody1/nobody1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/24/arts/nobody1/nobody1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'heigh