 “generational investment” to improve the nation’s transit and water systems and address climate change and racial inequities, as Democrats began laying the groundwork to pass sweeping infrastructure proposals that could cost $3 trillion to $4 trillion.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/26/us/politics/26new-washington-briefing-buttigieg/merlin_185079021_1ad07b0f-cec7-4e5b-bd9b-2ac377ea7eb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/26/us/politics/26new-washington-briefing-buttigieg/merlin_185079021_1ad07b0f-cec7-4e5b-bd9b-2ac377ea7eb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/26/us/politics/26new-washington-briefing-buttigieg/merlin_185079021_1ad07b0f-cec7-4e5b-bd9b-2ac377ea7eb1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/26/us/politics/26new-washington-briefing-buttigieg/merlin_185079021_1ad07b0f-cec7-4e5b-bd9b-2ac377ea7eb1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/26/us/politics/26new-washington-briefing-buttigieg/merlin_185079021_1ad07b0f-cec7-4e5b-bd9b-2ac377ea7eb1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/26/us/politics/26new-washington-briefing-buttigieg/merlin_185079021_1ad07b0f-cec7-4e5b-bd9b-2ac377ea7eb1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/26/us/politics/26new-washington-briefing-buttigieg/merlin_185079021_1ad07b0f-cec7-4e5b-bd9b-2ac377ea7eb1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Buttigieg asks Congress for ‘generational investment’ in infrastructure as Democrats mull how to draw Republican support.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2021-03-26T13:00:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Emily Cochrane and Pranshu Verma', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emily', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cochrane', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Pranshu', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Verma', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/97784973-db1a-5549-8b42-176e52e9c8f5', 'word_count': 429, 'uri': 'nyt://article/97784973-db1a-5549-8b42-176e52e9c8f5'}, {'abstract': 'Salvatore Ferragamo’s Invisible Sandal was a marvel when it was introduced in 1947. This season, its signature heel is back.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/26/t-magazine/fashion/salvatore-ferragamo-invisible-sandal.html', 'snippet': 'Salvatore Ferragamo’s Invisible Sandal was a marvel when it was introduced in 1947. This season, its signature heel is back.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Salvatore Ferragamo made his first pair of shoes when he was 9 years old: When his family couldn’t afford to buy white Mary Janes for his sister’s first communion, he borrowed nails, thread and canvas from a local cobbler and stayed up all night making her a pair. By age 12, he was running his own shoe shop in Bonito, a small village east of Naples. About five years later, in 1915, he emigrated to the United States and soon began designing footwear for Hollywood film studios and the director Cecil B. DeMille. Eventually, he counted Mary Pickford, Greta Garbo, Douglas Fairbanks and Rudolph Valentino among his clients.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '106', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/26/t-magazine/26tmag-ferragamo-02-copy/26tmag-ferragamo-02-copy-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/26/t-magazine/26tmag-ferragamo-02-copy/26tmag-ferragamo-02-copy-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/26/t-magazine/26tmag-ferragamo-02-copy/26tmag-ferragamo-02-copy-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 442, 'width': 662, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/26/t-magazine/26tmag-ferragamo-02-copy/26tmag-ferragamo-02-copy-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 442, 'width': 662, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/26/t-magazine/26tmag-ferragamo-02-copy/26tmag-ferragamo-02-copy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/26/t-magazine/26tmag-ferragamo-02-copy/26tmag-ferragamo-02-copy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/26/t-magazine/26tmag-ferragamo-02-copy/26tmag-ferragamo-02-copy-th