nswer was the expectation of a reply or what children refer to as ‘free stuff.’”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/26/books/2626CLEARY-APPRECIATION-sub/2626CLEARY-APPRECIATION-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/26/books/2626CLEARY-APPRECIATION-sub/2626CLEARY-APPRECIATION-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/26/books/2626CLEARY-APPRECIATION-sub/2626CLEARY-APPRECIATION-sub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/26/books/2626CLEARY-APPRECIATION-sub/2626CLEARY-APPRECIATION-sub-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 903, 'width': 1355, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/26/books/2626CLEARY-APPRECIATION-sub/2626CLEARY-APPRECIATION-sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/26/books/2626CLEARY-APPRECIATION-sub/2626CLEARY-APPRECIATION-sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/26/books/2626CLEARY-APPRECIATION-sub/2626CLEARY-APPRECIATION-sub-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Beverly Cleary Wrote About Real Life, and Her Readers Loved Her for It', 'kicke