ckdowns flock there even amid a simmering separatist movement and a security clampdown.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/27/world/asia/gulmarg-kashmir-himalaya-skiing.html', 'snippet': 'A Kashmir resort is welcoming the highest number of skiers in decades as Indians eager to get outdoors after lockdowns flock there even amid a simmering separatist movement and a security clampdown.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GULMARG, Kashmir — As a soft snowfall blanketed everything around her, Nihad Ashraf Khan, a college student who had been cooped up for months because of the pandemic, ran up to her attic and almost frantically grabbed for her skis, poles, boots and goggles — and headed immediately for the Himalayas.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/22/world/00kashmir-ski-dispatch-promo/merlin_185063748_9aaad883-1edf-45dc-ac20-ff24f5e55fef-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/22/world/00kashmir-ski-dispatch-promo/merlin_185063748_9aaad883-1edf-45dc-ac20-ff24f5e55fef-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/22/world/00kashmir-ski-dispatch-promo/merlin_185063748_9aaad883-1edf-45dc-ac20-ff24f5e55fef-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/22/world/00kashmir-ski-dispatch-promo/merlin_185063748_9aaad883-1edf-45dc-ac20-ff24f5e55fef-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url