er', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/98a474ec-115a-5c18-8b7b-aede853ed185', 'word_count': 254, 'uri': 'nyt://article/98a474ec-115a-5c18-8b7b-aede853ed185'}, {'abstract': 'He was hailed for leading the rescue of Apollo 13 astronauts when their spacecraft was rocked by an explosion en route to the moon, and for helping guide them home.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/27/us/glynn-s-lunney-dead.html', 'snippet': 'He was hailed for leading the rescue of Apollo 13 astronauts when their spacecraft was rocked by an explosion en route to the moon, and for helping guide them home.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Glynn S. Lunney, the NASA flight director who played a major role in America’s space program and was hailed for his leadership in the rescue of three Apollo 13 astronauts when their spacecraft was rocked by an explosion en route to the moon in 1970, died on March 19 at his home in Clear Lake, Texas. He was 84.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/25/obituaries/25Lunney-2/merlin_185527995_2d7424f9-70c1-4280-b1ee-1844c51bb3c7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 414, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/25/obituaries/25Lunney-2/merlin_185527995_2d7424f9-70c1-4280-b1ee-1844c51bb3c7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 414}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/25/obituaries/25Lunney-2/merlin_185527995_2d7424f9-70c1-4280-b1ee-1844c51bb3c7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 706, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/25