creating an equitable vaccine system and more.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/30/magazine/a-hygienist-had-covid-shouldnt-my-dentist-have-told-me.html', 'snippet': 'The magazine’s Ethicist columnist on balancing health care providers’ privacy against patients’ concerns, creating an equitable vaccine system and more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I was planning to make an appointment with a hygienist working under my dentist and was told by a third party that one of the hygienists had contracted Covid, been treated and was back to work. I am 69, and my nephew died of Covid last May. Four other relatives contracted the virus and recovered. I am nervous about the pandemic.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/04/magazine/04mag-ethicist/04mag-ethicist-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 476, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/04/magazine/04mag-ethicist/04mag-ethicist-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 476}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/04/magazine/04mag-ethicist/04mag-ethicist-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 812, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/04/magazine/04mag-ethicist/04mag-ethicist-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1223, 'width': 1543, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/04/magazine/04mag-ethicist/04mag-ethicist-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/04/magazine/04mag-ethicist/04mag