pus — played by real octopuses.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/04/arts/04godzilla-kong1/merlin_184285041_4926a599-c5ff-4b15-8b9f-0a90b68b66ef-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 285, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/04/arts/04godzilla-kong1/merlin_184285041_4926a599-c5ff-4b15-8b9f-0a90b68b66ef-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 285}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/04/arts/04godzilla-kong1/merlin_184285041_4926a599-c5ff-4b15-8b9f-0a90b68b66ef-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 486, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/04/arts/04godzilla-kong1/merlin_184285041_4926a599-c5ff-4b15-8b9f-0a90b68b66ef-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 972, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/04/arts/04godzilla-kong1/04godzilla-kong1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/04/04/arts/04godzilla-kong1/04godzilla-kong1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/04/arts/04godzilla-kong1/04godzilla-kong1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'When King Kong Accidentally Met Godzilla', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'King Kong and Godzilla: A History', 'na