ash began.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/31/business/hm-responds-to-a-firestorm-in-china-over-xinjiang-cotton.html', 'snippet': 'The Swedish retailer said it was “dedicated to regaining trust and confidence” in China, more than a week after the backlash began.', 'lead_paragraph': 'More than a week after the Swedish retailer H&M came under fire in China for a months-old statement expressing concern over reports of Uyghur forced labor in the region of Xinjiang, a major source of cotton, the company published a statement saying it hoped to regain the trust of customers in China.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/31/business/31economy-briefing-handm/merlin_185794005_2ff1243a-8158-4f34-add7-3f84904944fe-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 412, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/31/business/31economy-briefing-handm/merlin_185794005_2ff1243a-8158-4f34-add7-3f84904944fe-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 412}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/31/business/31economy-briefing-handm/merlin_185794005_2ff1243a-8158-4f34-add7-3f84904944fe-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 703, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/31/business/31economy-briefing-handm/merlin_185794005_2ff1243a-8158-4f34-add7-3f84904944fe-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1406, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/31/business/31economy-briefing-handm/31economy-briefing-handm-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': '