, it’s no coincidence that Georgia — once a Republican stronghold — has just elected its first Black senator: Raphael Warnock. Today, we speak to the senator about his path from pastorship to politics, the fight over voting rights and his faith that the old political order is fading away.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Conversation With Senator Raphael Warnock', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2020', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Georgia', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Warnock, Raphael G', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voting and Voters', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-03-31T09:55:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Podcasts', 'section_name': 'Podcasts', 'subsection_name': 'The Daily', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d9496086-ab85-5cd8-9c99-cfdcca8d982a', 'word_count': 312, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d9496086-ab85-5cd8-9c99-cfdcca8d982a'}, {'abstract': 'These large, long-lived trees support more life-forms than any other trees in North America. And they’re magnificent.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/31/realestate/oak-trees-why-you-should-plant.html', 'snippet': 'These large, long-lived trees support more life-forms than any other trees in North America. And they’re magnificent.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When I arrived years ago at the piece of land I now garden, I saw it as a blank canvas and set about madly planting things, imagining my efforts would bring every square foot to life. I did not understand then that the heavy lifting had already been done — and probably by some blue jay, or maybe a squirrel.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/29/realestate/31garden1/oakImage-1617054677967-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/29/realestate/31garden1/oakImage-1617054677967-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/29/realestate/31garden1/oakImage-1617054677967-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/29/realestate/31garden1/oakImage-1617054677967-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/29/realestate/31garden1/oakImage-1617054677967-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/29/realestate/31garden1/oakImage-1617054677967-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/29/realestate/31garden1/oakImage-1617054677967-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Why You Should Plant Oaks', 'kicker': 'IN THE GARDEN', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gardens and Gardening', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Trees and Shrubs', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-03-31T10:00:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'RealEstate', 'section_name': 'Real Estate', 'byline': {'original': 'By Margaret Roach', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Margaret', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Roach', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/373f56c4-ee0e-5ffd-9e9e-2917d4292fc3', 'word_count': 1605, 'uri': 'nyt://article/373f56c4-ee0e-5ffd-9e9e-2917d4292fc3'}, {'abstract': 'Juventus reimagined its look, P.S.G. partnered with Jordan Brand, and now Arsenal and Inter Milan are following suit. But soccer’s interest in design has little to do with the sport.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/31/sports/soccer/soccer-streetwear-juventus.html', 'snippet': 'Juventus reimagined its look, P.S.G. partnered with Jordan Brand, and now Arsenal and Inter Milan are following suit. But soccer’s interest in design has little to do with the sport.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The lights at the Allianz Stadium cut out, and the music swelled. In the darkness, a small patch in the middle of the field seemed to glow. The center circle started to pulse and ripple. And then the grass itself appeared to get pulled away, as if it were nothing more than a tablecloth. Three words ran around the electronic advertising boards: “History. Passion. Lols.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images