article/88aaf421-ce76-5e70-8b73-c09a44259921'}, {'abstract': 'Cases are rising again in the U.S., even as the vaccine campaign accelerates. We explain why.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/31/briefing/matt-gaetz-investigation-g-gordon-liddy-mali.html', 'snippet': 'Cases are rising again in the U.S., even as the vaccine campaign accelerates. We explain why.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The news about the state of the pandemic in the U.S. has been largely positive in the past few months. The vaccines are highly effective, and millions of people are receiving doses each day. Cases, hospitalizations and deaths have fallen sharply from their January peaks.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/28/world/31ambriefing-promo/PM-virus-fader-slide-BRLZ-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/03/28/world/31ambriefing-promo/PM-virus-fader-slide-BRLZ-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/28/world/31ambriefing-promo/PM-virus-fader-slide-BRLZ-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/28/world/31ambriefing-promo/PM-virus-fader-slide-BRLZ-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/28/world/31ambriefing-promo/PM-virus-fader-slide-BRLZ-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/03/28/world/31ambriefing-promo/PM-virus-fader-slide-BRLZ-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/28/world/31ambriefing-promo/PM-virus-fader-slide-BRLZ-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Caution vs. Optimism', 'kicker': 'The Morning Newsletter', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2021-03-31T10:32:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'NYTNow', 'section_name': 'Briefing', 'byline': {'original': 'By the staff of The Morning', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The staff of The Morning'}, 'type_of_material': 'briefing', '_id': 'nyt://article/cfc59231-10f1-54c5-b229-a887819d0c2a', 'word_count': 1475, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cfc59231-10f1-54c5-b229-a887819d0c2a'}, {'abstract': 'A clinical trial found no symptomatic infections among vaccinated children ages 12 to 15, the companies said, and there were no serious side effects. The data have not yet been reviewed by independent experts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/03/31/health/pfizer-biontech-vaccine-adolescents.html', 'snippet': 'A clinical trial found no symptomatic infections among vaccinated children ages 12 to 15, the companies said, and there were no serious side effects. The data have not yet been reviewed by independent experts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Pfizer-BioNTech coronavirus vaccine is extremely effective in young adolescents, perhaps even more so than in adults, the companies reported on Wednesday — a finding that could ease the return to normalcy for millions of American families. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/03/31/science/31virus-children-1/merlin_183586632_ad4424a8-2bfa-4718-b45